 داشته باشند، دانش‌آموزان تجربی به ۴ حالت در سه جایگاه از ۶ جایگاه شماره‌گذاری شده قرار می‌گیرند.\n۱ $\\bigcirc$ ۲ $\\bigcirc$ ۳ $\\bigcirc$ ۴ $\\bigcirc$ ۵ $\\bigcirc$ ۶\n$(۱, ۲, ۳)$ یا $(۲, ۳, ۴)$ یا $(۳, ۴, ۵)$ یا $(۴, ۵, ۶)$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\dfrac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\dfrac{۴ \\times ۳! \\times ۵!}{۸!} = \\dfrac{۴ \\times ۶!}{۸!} = \\dfrac{۴}{۸ \\times ۷} = \\dfrac{۱}{۱۴}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۲۷","aspect_ratio":1.7364}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/solution_6.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"3530dc71e8c413e3de27e07d28c54aa882c8d9bcbb083fb2ecfe8081b0150a3c","bytes":98},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"d7444739434c771905b4740972fe78836ec14fee9baa349a33a2db8b0c44a779","bytes":1984},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"7ef9819d231885e35ee2ea2ab368f2a1a0bc526d8fe9feebcf9d818b6d09139f","bytes":924},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ef96782c93f4e3bf1950c69f346d7d65ee7895e0e3dc6c3dffe3046fb4d1af54","bytes":980},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/solution_6.webp","sha256":"09f4a97babe1a5a10c5ce7f371d82758befa27b1aeb4dc302edf9527330f4aa5","bytes":23422},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1827/stem_1.webp","sha256":"dba28376afce59210179a581b7f24cf08113a3320d64bd70504f5dc53af160cb","bytes":7244}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1827,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":10,"solution_page":169,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1828","source_sha256":"74e231fc7a40f5c61dab5e07efa4062bb6e56a101fc65d5433dada2398b03b1c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"۴ دختر و ۵ پسر در یک مهد کودک قرار است در یک صف بایستند، به کدام احتمال دخترها کنار هم هستند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1828","aspect_ratio":0.0398}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{\\binom{9}{4}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.7396}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{6}{\\binom{9}{4}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.7184}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{\\binom{9}{4}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.7862}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{\\binom{9}{4}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.7396}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"دخترها را داخل یک جعبهٔ فرضی قرار می‌دهیم.\n$P(A) = \\dfrac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\dfrac{۶! \\times ۴!}{۹!} = \\dfrac{۶ \\times ۵! \\times ۴!}{۹!} = \\dfrac{۶}{\\dfrac{۹!}{۴! \\times ۵!}} = \\dfrac{۶}{\\binom{۹}{۴}}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/solution_6.webp","alt":"راه حل سوال ۱۸۲۸","aspect_ratio":3.3481}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1828/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nar